libclipboard
------------------------------------------
libclipboard is a cross-platform clipboard library written in C. It supports
reading and writing text on the Windows, X11 and macOS clipboards, and provides
custom allocator support.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libclipboard-devel-1.1-1bl1
  libclipboard1.1-1.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/jtanx/libclipboard

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/jtanx/libclipboard/archive/refs/tags/v1.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libclipboard-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libclipboard-1.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libclipboard-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libclipboard-1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libclipboard1.1-1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libclipboard-devel-1.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libclipboard)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libclipboard.README
  /usr/share/doc/libclipboard/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libclipboard/README.md

(libclipboard1.1)
  /usr/bin/cygclipboard-1.1.dll

(libclipboard-devel)
  /usr/include/libclipboard-config.h
  /usr/include/libclipboard.h
  /usr/lib/libclipboard.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libclipboard.pc

